  "servicesIntroTitle": "Pet Size Categories",
  "servicesIntroText": "Pet Size\tWeight Range\tTypical Examples\n────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSmall\t0–20 lb\tChihuahua, Yorkie, Shih Tzu, Maltese, Pomeranian, small cats\nMedium\t21–50 lb\tBeagle, Cocker Spaniel, Miniature Schnauzer, French Bulldog, medium-sized cats\nLarge\t51–90 lb\tLabrador Retriever, Golden Retriever, German Shepherd, Boxer, Standard Poodle\n\nPets over 90 lb, severely matted pets, or pets requiring extended handling may receive a custom quote.",
  "servicesNotesTitle": "Pricing Notes",
